\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Where the movement lives.} (a) Across-scale range of cooperation for each model-by-language pair; the range of the ranges is an order of magnitude, from 0.083 to 0.855. (b) Share of the variance across the 250 cell means carried by each term of a type-II analysis of variance. The interaction of the payoff scale with the model carries about three times what the scale main effect carries.}}{9}{figure.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:heterogeneity}{{4}{9}{\textbf {Where the movement lives.} (a) Across-scale range of cooperation for each model-by-language pair; the range of the ranges is an order of magnitude, from 0.083 to 0.855. (b) Share of the variance across the 250 cell means carried by each term of a type-II analysis of variance. The interaction of the payoff scale with the model carries about three times what the scale main effect carries}{figure.4}{}}
